WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Press M and type a message about the change

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.900
Claude asks to edit the file; the pane shows the request

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.500
Press y, then y to allow it

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.100
The edit is made, and the review reads the file again
